# Production build override: guarantees `vite build` always points at the
# deployed Render backend, even if a developer's local .env.local (which
# intentionally points at localhost for `npm run dev`) is present on the
# machine that runs the build. Vite loads .env.production after .env.local,
# so this value always wins for production builds.
VITE_API_URL=https://client-dashboard-zokm.onrender.com
